# The quit confirmation: the message box with the game logo, a 640 x 360 dialog centred (x 640..1280, y 360..720) on a
# 40% scrim. Button slots as in MessageBox.layout (slot 1 right, slot 3 left). The unnamed rule under the title is
# matched by its legacy rect.
hide at:248,135,555,136
scrim
window $MessageBoxParent centre middle 0 0 640 360 dialog
window $StaticTextTitle left top 664 384 592 32 section
window $Logo left top 758 428 404 130
window $StaticTextMessage left top 664 572 592 56 body
window $ButtonCancel left top 664 652 180 44 button
window $ButtonNo left top 870 652 180 44 button
window $ButtonOk left top 1076 652 180 44 primary
window $ButtonYes left top 1076 652 180 44 primary
